WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:08.901
Systems is the back office for film and TV: bookings, timesheets, invoices and all the paperwork in between.

2
00:00:09.151 --> 00:00:15.702
Start on the website. Pick your job, and every example changes to fit it.

3
00:00:15.952 --> 00:00:24.902
Tap Try it free. It opens straight on a dashboard full of sample data, so you can try everything first.

4
00:00:25.153 --> 00:00:32.504
Nothing you do here is saved, so it's a safe place to have a look around.

5
00:00:32.754 --> 00:00:39.704
Down the side are your pages: Home, Bookings, Money, and the pages for your job.

6
00:00:39.954 --> 00:00:46.505
To see it as someone else, switch job at the top. Here's a gaffer.

7
00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:53.705
Crew get a diary, offers straight from producers, and every job's status in one place.

8
00:00:53.955 --> 00:01:00.106
Under More are your details, your rate, and where your work is kept.

9
00:01:00.356 --> 00:01:08.907
When you're ready, join the waitlist. The first version opens to the waitlist first.

